Source: pg-checksums-ext
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/VictorNagibator/pg_checksums

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-checksums-ext
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-checksums-ext
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Multi-level data integrity checksum functions for PostgreSQL PGVERSION
 pg_checksums provides SQL checksum functions for pages, cells, tuples,
 tables, indexes and databases, with physical and logical variants.
 This extension is separate from the PGDG pg_checksums command-line tool.
